1
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,400
Look.

2
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,599
Is he okay?

3
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,159
Is he busy recently?

4
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,040
I heard that

5
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,640
He'll fight the Physical Education Institute's students again.

6
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,840
For this game,

7
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:03,920
Yan has been working hard at home

8
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,799
to do data analysis every day.

9
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,359
If you really

10
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,560
don't want to let him down,

11
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,800
then hurry up,

12
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,400
go back and train hard.

13
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:12,319
Make sure to

14
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:13,840
do well in this game.

15
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:19,199
Listen to me,

16
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,599
go back now.

17
00:02:25,199 --> 00:02:25,919
Fu Binyan,

18
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,560
we will definitely win the game,

19
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:28,840
and bring the victory

20
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,639
to you when you get out of the hospital.

21
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:35,120
We will work hard,

22
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,439
and carry Fu Binyan's spirit.

23
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:39,000
Auntie,

24
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,000
we'll be going now.

25
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,120
Take care.

26
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,080
Okay.

27
00:02:43,759 --> 00:02:44,840
Go back now.

28
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,319
Goodbye, auntie.

29
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:28,439
What should we do?

30
00:03:28,759 --> 00:03:29,919
We lost the game.

31
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:32,080
How can we face Fu Binyan?

32
00:03:33,639 --> 00:03:34,560
We thought of so many tactics

33
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,039
to deal with Xie Yizhou,

34
00:03:36,919 --> 00:03:38,280
but he didn't play

35
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,280
in the end.

36
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,000
I heard he's recovered.

37
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:45,800
He didn't play

38
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:47,000
on purpose.

39
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,680
Xie Yizhou

40
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:52,479
is like a sesame dumpling.

41
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:54,120
He looks innocent,

42
00:03:54,479 --> 00:03:55,840
but he's a bad guy.

43
00:03:59,039 --> 00:04:00,039
Then

44
00:04:00,039 --> 00:04:01,520
in the next game,

45
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:02,879
we can only win

46
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:03,840
and can't lose, right?

47
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:05,599
Yes.

48
00:04:19,639 --> 00:04:20,360
No.

49
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,560
I feel too bad.

50
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,720
I want to hit the wall.

51
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,920
I'm kidding.

52
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,560
I suddenly miss Fu Binyan so much.

53
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:40,399
At this time,

54
00:04:40,639 --> 00:04:42,199
he would say something unpleasant.

55
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:44,000
We were stimulated by him.

56
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:45,879
Maybe we wouldn't feel so bad.

57
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:47,319
Yes.

58
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,480
If he were here

59
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,560
and saw us like this,

60
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,759
he would say

61
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,720
the next game is so important.

62
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,600
You still have time

63
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,920
sighing here.

64
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,480
You might as well hit the wall.

65
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,639
Especially Lin Qingyuan.

66
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,920
You learned it quite well.

67
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,279
That's right.

68
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:10,920
Fu Binyan must

69
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,000
know we lost.

70
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:13,839
If at this time

71
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:15,000
we fall into despair,

72
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:17,199
he will definitely be furious.

73
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:20,360
Shut up.

74
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,720
If it's Fu Binyan,

75
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:28,199
the result of the competition

76
00:05:28,199 --> 00:05:29,040
may not be

77
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,160
that important to him.

78
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:32,480
What's the most important?

79
00:05:34,079 --> 00:05:35,639
Our attitude towards winning or losing.

80
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:45,920
I see.

81
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:47,160
What?

82
00:05:49,279 --> 00:05:50,120
What?

83
00:05:51,519 --> 00:05:52,800
You really hit the wall.

84
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:09,319
Come on, three, two, one.

85
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,800
How do you feel?

86
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,600
Pretty good.

87
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,160
I should

88
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,839
be able to get out of the hospital soon.

89
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,199
Whether you can get out of the hospital

90
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:17,600
depends on the doctor.

91
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,879
Yan,

92
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,079
getting sick

93
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:28,240
has caused you

94
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:29,720
some trouble, hasn't it?

95
00:08:39,279 --> 00:08:40,919
I checked your watch's

96
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:42,080
heart rate monitor.

97
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,000
It had shown irregularities

98
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,480
before,

99
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,679
but hadn't reached the alarm threshold.

100
00:08:49,399 --> 00:08:50,960
I didn't get a notification,

101
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,279
and you didn't tell me.

102
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,759
So fainting while climbing stairs

103
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,200
wasn't just a coincidence.

104
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,559
Did you push yourself too hard?

105
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:05,159
The doctor said

106
00:09:05,919 --> 00:09:07,279
my heart has recovered.

107
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,960
I'm just like a normal person.

108
00:09:10,039 --> 00:09:11,519
I can't play basketball anymore.

109
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:14,080
If I have to be careful

110
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,360
even when climbing stairs,

111
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:17,679
what's the difference between me and a disabled person?

112
00:09:19,519 --> 00:09:22,120
So you wanted to give it a try.

113
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,960
If this time there's no problem with climbing stairs,

114
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,600
next, you'll start running,

115
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,960
and then playing basketball again.

116
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:31,639
right?

117
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:42,960
You're doing the right thing.

118
00:09:45,679 --> 00:09:46,679
I'm with you.

119
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,879
I don't want you

120
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:53,080
to live in fear

121
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:55,440
because of this disease.

122
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,399
You want to take control again.

123
00:09:58,399 --> 00:09:59,480
That's not wrong.

124
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:00,759
It's just that

125
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:02,039
we have to learn

126
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,440
to live with it in peace.

127
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,320
Live in harmony with it.

128
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,200
Don't try to fight it.

129
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,440
That's suicide.

130
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,519
But don't be afraid of it.

131
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,600
This time you got sick

132
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,399
was not just because

133
00:10:15,399 --> 00:10:17,039
you climbed stairs.

134
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,559
It's because of

135
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:21,279
your staying up late, fighting, watching performances,

136
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,720
and all these things accumulated

137
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,840
to cause the result.

138
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:27,320
As long as we learn from this,

139
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,320
your heart will definitely

140
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,440
get healthier.

141
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,320
But, Mom,

142
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,600
don't you worry about me?

143
00:10:41,279 --> 00:10:42,440
Of course I do.

144
00:10:42,679 --> 00:10:44,200
I'm worried.

145
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:46,080
But

146
00:10:46,679 --> 00:10:48,399
I want you to be happy.

147
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:52,320
So what I can do now

148
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,559
is to do my best

149
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:54,879
to support you,

150
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:57,759
and use the best medical resources

151
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:58,879
to back you up.

152
00:11:03,799 --> 00:11:05,200
But what if

153
00:11:05,519 --> 00:11:07,200
the worst-case scenario

154
00:11:08,039 --> 00:11:08,720
happens?

155
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,720
I certainly don't hope

156
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,960
that the worst-case scenario will occur.

157
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:21,759
But if

158
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,799
it comes to that,

159
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,480
I hope

160
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,840
you can live with fewer regrets.

161
00:11:38,639 --> 00:11:39,240
Mom,

162
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:40,960
what about you?

163
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,080
Yan,

164
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:51,799
do you know

165
00:11:51,799 --> 00:11:52,960
how I feel

166
00:11:53,159 --> 00:11:54,919
every time I wait

167
00:11:54,919 --> 00:11:56,519
for the court decision?

168
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:04,600
As long as

169
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:07,679
I give it my all,

170
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:09,320
I won't regret it.

171
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,840
No matter what the result is,

172
00:12:12,759 --> 00:12:14,039
I can accept it.

173
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,399
It's the same with you.

174
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,320
We have reached a consensus.

175
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,960
It's a deal.

176
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:37,360
Well,

177
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:39,279
I'm going to make a work call.

178
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,879
You continue reading.

179
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:41,480
Bin Yan,

180
00:14:41,679 --> 00:14:42,120
here,

181
00:14:42,559 --> 00:14:43,240
Have some water.

182
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,159
Your mom

183
00:14:47,159 --> 00:14:48,559
told me about your situation.

184
00:14:48,879 --> 00:14:50,000
I've also talked to your class advisor

185
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:50,759
and the PE teacher.

186
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:51,720
They know about it.

187
00:14:51,919 --> 00:14:54,440
In the future, for things like flag raising,

188
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:55,879
calisthenics,

189
00:14:55,879 --> 00:14:57,440
and PE class,

190
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,080
if you feel up to it,

191
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,600
and you want to participate, go ahead.

192
00:15:00,879 --> 00:15:02,080
If you don't feel well,

193
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,080
you can ask for leave at any time.

194
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,360
We won't record your absence.

195
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:06,559
Director,

196
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,240
I'm not that fragile.

197
00:15:08,679 --> 00:15:09,440
It's not necessary.

198
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,240
Bin Yan,

199
00:15:13,639 --> 00:15:14,879
since you joined our school,

200
00:15:14,879 --> 00:15:16,200
you've been excellent.

201
00:15:16,639 --> 00:15:17,559
I've always seen you

202
00:15:17,559 --> 00:15:18,679
as my capable assistant.

203
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,679
You've been involved in

204
00:15:20,679 --> 00:15:21,720
all the activities of the school.

205
00:15:22,159 --> 00:15:23,240
Violin,

206
00:15:23,639 --> 00:15:25,960
competitions,

207
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:28,480
student union, and clubs.

208
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,080
You've done them all.

209
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,879
Now that I think about it,

210
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:34,279
I feel quite guilty.

211
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:35,399
Director,

212
00:15:35,759 --> 00:15:37,480
this is just a normal student life.

213
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:38,679
I don't think there's any problem.

214
00:15:39,039 --> 00:15:40,000
No, it's different.

215
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,039
I've looked into it.

216
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,600
Fatigue is very likely

217
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:45,639
to be

218
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:47,879
the triggering factor of your disease.

219
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:52,960
Heart problems can be serious.

220
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:55,080
We can't take any chances.

221
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:57,080
Anyway, you'll be

222
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:58,960
a priority from now on.

223
00:15:59,519 --> 00:16:00,080
Director,

224
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,080
just listen to me.

225
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:02,759
It's really not that serious.

226
00:16:02,759 --> 00:16:03,799
I'll take this call.

227
00:16:07,279 --> 00:16:07,720
Hello?

228
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:10,720
Yes, yes.

229
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,960
Fu Binyan has returned.

230
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:13,679
From now on,

231
00:16:13,679 --> 00:16:14,960
please take good care of him.

232
00:16:15,519 --> 00:16:16,519
If he feels unwell,

233
00:16:16,519 --> 00:16:18,039
he should come to your infirmary.

234
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,600
Please give him priority.

235
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:20,840
Okay.

236
00:16:21,559 --> 00:16:22,000
Yes.

237
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:22,720
Okay.

238
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,600
Thank you.

239
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:24,840
Okay.

240
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:26,399
Director

241
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,200
The infirmary

242
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:28,879
has known

243
00:16:28,879 --> 00:16:30,080
your latest situation.

244
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:30,840
Don't worry.

245
00:16:32,799 --> 00:16:33,799
There is another important thing

246
00:16:33,799 --> 00:16:35,039
I want to tell you.

247
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:37,120
You are now in the student union

248
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,360
and the basketball club.

249
00:16:38,679 --> 00:16:39,559
You have a lot of work to do.

250
00:16:40,799 --> 00:16:42,200
I think

251
00:16:42,919 --> 00:16:44,879
you can quit the basketball club.

252
00:16:46,159 --> 00:16:47,159
I recommended you to the club

253
00:16:47,159 --> 00:16:48,480
in the first place.

254
00:16:49,159 --> 00:16:49,720
Now

255
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:50,879
you can quit after you have done your job.

256
00:16:51,759 --> 00:16:52,960
It's reasonable.

257
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,440
Just listen to me.

258
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,200
Come on, have some water.

259
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,079
Fu Binyan

260
00:17:22,799 --> 00:17:23,759
You lost weight.

261
00:17:24,519 --> 00:17:25,240
You look pale.

262
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,039
You also look haggard.

263
00:17:27,519 --> 00:17:28,839
Your family must be worried about you.

264
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,079
Coach

265
00:17:30,359 --> 00:17:31,440
Don't worry.

266
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:32,519
I'm just like this.

267
00:17:36,599 --> 00:17:37,720
Director Qian has told me.

268
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:38,680
I have also discussed with

269
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:39,559
Teacher Wang.

270
00:17:39,559 --> 00:17:40,519
As for the Basketball Club,

271
00:17:40,519 --> 00:17:41,599
if you find it hard,

272
00:17:41,599 --> 00:17:42,799
you can put it off for a while.

273
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:44,559
Don't worry.

274
00:17:44,559 --> 00:17:46,200
Your final score won't be affected.

275
00:17:48,519 --> 00:17:49,519
It's the same old song.

276
00:17:51,359 --> 00:17:52,160
Of course.

277
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:53,640
I can see that

278
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:55,640
you really love basketball.

279
00:18:02,039 --> 00:18:03,000
So,

280
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,599
if you want to stay,

281
00:18:04,599 --> 00:18:05,599
no problem.

282
00:18:05,599 --> 00:18:07,559
Come by after school every day.

283
00:18:07,559 --> 00:18:08,519
Just have fun.

284
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:11,720
Actually,

285
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:12,799
my regularization

286
00:18:12,799 --> 00:18:14,200
is pretty much a sure thing.

287
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,160
Next,

288
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,319
I'll have more time

289
00:18:16,319 --> 00:18:17,400
to devote to the club,

290
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:19,559
and Gu Chenyang can help me out.

291
00:18:19,559 --> 00:18:20,519
Don't feel pressured.

292
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:23,000
You mean

293
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,720
I can just be a name on the roster,

294
00:18:25,079 --> 00:18:26,079
and do nothing?

295
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,839
No problem at all.

296
00:18:28,759 --> 00:18:30,200
What's the point of that?

297
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,519
To be a mascot?

298
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:36,799
Do I look like a mascot to you?

299
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,039
Coach

300
00:18:41,359 --> 00:18:42,480
Thank you for your concern.

301
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,319
But if it's like this,

302
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:46,000
I'd rather quit the club.

303
00:18:52,759 --> 00:18:53,480
Well, isn't my plan

304
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:54,440
good enough?

305
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:06,480
You are now in the student union

306
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,720
and the basketball club.

307
00:19:08,039 --> 00:19:08,920
It's not easy.

308
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:11,359
If it's not okay, let's quit the basketball club.

309
00:19:11,359 --> 00:19:12,359
If he feels unwell,

310
00:19:12,359 --> 00:19:13,759
he can go to your infirmary at any time.

311
00:19:14,119 --> 00:19:15,319
You should take care of him first.

312
00:19:15,319 --> 00:19:16,200
As for the Basketball Club,

313
00:19:16,279 --> 00:19:17,359
if you feel overwhelmed,

314
00:19:17,359 --> 00:19:18,759
you can take a break.

315
00:19:18,759 --> 00:19:19,880
You can go there

316
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:21,039
after school every day.

317
00:19:21,039 --> 00:19:22,119
Just for fun.

318
00:19:28,559 --> 00:19:30,039
Fu Binyan, you're back.

319
00:19:30,039 --> 00:19:31,079
I'm looking for you.

320
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:36,680
Where are you going?

321
00:19:37,119 --> 00:19:38,160
I have something to tell you.

322
00:19:40,319 --> 00:19:41,119
What do you want?

323
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,960
I want you to teach me how to play basketball.

324
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:44,559
Last time,

325
00:19:44,759 --> 00:19:46,839
I was tightly guarded by No. 8 of the other team.

326
00:19:46,839 --> 00:19:48,880
I couldn't break through.

327
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:51,400
Zhou Yang said you were good at breaking through.

328
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:53,079
I've been waiting for you to get out of the hospital

329
00:19:53,079 --> 00:19:54,480
to teach me how to play basketball.

330
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:57,480
I can't.

331
00:20:01,799 --> 00:20:03,400
This morning, Teacher Wang came to me

332
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:06,640
and said that we should try to arrange less work

333
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:07,960
for Fu Binyan in the student union in the future.

334
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,319
He's afraid that Fu Binyan's body can't withstand it.

335
00:20:11,319 --> 00:20:13,000
Coach Su also sent me a message.

336
00:20:13,319 --> 00:20:14,599
He has a similar idea.

337
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:16,240
He wants to let him take on less burden.

338
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:17,799
What do you mean?

339
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:20,119
Don't let Fu Binyan do anything?

340
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,880
The teachers are worried.

341
00:20:24,799 --> 00:20:26,400
Isn't that a bit too much?

342
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:28,079
Does Fu Binyan want that?

343
00:20:29,119 --> 00:20:30,559
Now I know why Fu Binyan

344
00:20:30,559 --> 00:20:32,039
wants us to keep it a secret.

345
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,519
If everyone knows

346
00:20:33,519 --> 00:20:34,720
he has heart problems,

347
00:20:35,079 --> 00:20:36,480
even with good intentions,

348
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:37,839
they might overreact.

349
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:40,359
Fu Binyan has heart problems?

350
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,039
Oh my!

351
00:20:42,039 --> 00:20:43,160
When did you get here?

352
00:20:44,119 --> 00:20:45,720
I've been here all the time.

353
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:46,599
It's you who didn't see me

354
00:20:46,599 --> 00:20:47,960
when you came over.

355
00:20:48,279 --> 00:20:49,119
What?

356
00:20:49,119 --> 00:20:50,279
Fu Binyan has heart disease?

357
00:20:50,279 --> 00:20:51,240
Is it that serious?

358
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,640
Keep your voice down.

359
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:53,559
Or do you think

360
00:20:53,559 --> 00:20:54,759
why he was hospitalized?

361
00:20:55,359 --> 00:20:56,359
Lin Qingyuan told me

362
00:20:56,359 --> 00:20:57,960
it's the after-effects of Guo Rui beating him up.

363
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:00,039
We were so angry that we almost went to Yudong

364
00:21:00,039 --> 00:21:01,200
to settle the score with them.

365
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,960
You two really are one who dares to guess,

366
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:03,960
and one who dares to believe.

367
00:21:04,839 --> 00:21:05,720
Oh my god.

368
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,400
Let me catch my breath.

369
00:21:20,079 --> 00:21:21,240
No wonder he

370
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:23,119
refused to join the Basketball Club.

371
00:21:27,599 --> 00:21:29,400
No wonder he joined the Basketball Club,

372
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:31,000
but refused to play on the court.

373
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:35,640
No wonder you often

374
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:36,680
help him out.

375
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:37,880
I see, I see.

376
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:39,000
I see everything.

377
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,759
See what?

378
00:21:41,079 --> 00:21:42,440
We are worried now.

379
00:21:42,799 --> 00:21:43,960
In this case,

380
00:21:43,960 --> 00:21:45,559
what if Fu Binyan is unhappy

381
00:21:45,559 --> 00:21:46,519
and quits the club?

382
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:49,680
According to Fu Binyan's personality,

383
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:50,640
if he really

384
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:51,640
can't do anything,

385
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:52,759
he will definitely quit.

386
00:21:53,599 --> 00:21:54,599
And

387
00:21:54,599 --> 00:21:56,240
once he makes up his mind,

388
00:21:56,599 --> 00:21:58,000
he won't change it.

389
00:22:01,599 --> 00:22:02,200
Oh, no.

390
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:03,640
What's wrong?

391
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:05,480
Lin Qingyuan went to find Fu Binyan.

392
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,559
What?

393
00:22:06,559 --> 00:22:07,759
Zhou Yang, didn't you say

394
00:22:07,759 --> 00:22:09,400
Fu Binyan is good at breaking through on the court?

395
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:10,200
Lin Qingyuan went to him

396
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,359
for one-on-one coaching.

397
00:22:11,839 --> 00:22:12,559
Oh no.

398
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:18,799
Hello everyone.

399
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:20,759
You're all here.

400
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,880
You went to see Fu Binyan?

401
00:22:24,799 --> 00:22:25,880
He taught you how to play basketball?

402
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,440
Stop just humming and hawing.

403
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:29,200
And then?

404
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:30,039
What's going on?

405
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:31,880
The situation is

406
00:22:32,319 --> 00:22:33,160
I've learned it.

407
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:38,799
Can't teach.

408
00:22:41,519 --> 00:22:42,599
Why can't you teach?

409
00:22:43,319 --> 00:22:45,240
It's because I lost the game last time,

410
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,319
you got angry.

411
00:22:47,039 --> 00:22:47,680
No.

412
00:22:48,599 --> 00:22:50,119
It's just because I'm not well enough

413
00:22:50,519 --> 00:22:51,319
to teach you.

414
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:54,839
And they won't let me teach you.

415
00:22:55,920 --> 00:22:56,640
Why?

416
00:22:57,079 --> 00:22:58,559
You just stayed in the hospital for a few days.

417
00:22:58,920 --> 00:22:59,920
You're not a cripple.

418
00:23:01,319 --> 00:23:02,319
What if I am?

419
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:20,119
You're fine.

420
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,119
You just stayed in the hospital.

421
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:23,720
How did you become like this?

422
00:23:24,359 --> 00:23:25,480
So depressed.

423
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:28,799
It's not me.

424
00:23:29,119 --> 00:23:29,799
It's everyone.

425
00:23:29,799 --> 00:23:31,119
We've all been through it.

426
00:23:31,400 --> 00:23:32,880
Zhou Yang was hospitalized,

427
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:34,480
and Gu Chenyang got injured.

428
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:35,279
They're fine now.

429
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:36,599
Look at me.

430
00:23:38,559 --> 00:23:39,519
It hurts so much.

431
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:42,640
The doctor said my joint is loose

432
00:23:43,319 --> 00:23:45,599
and might dislocate easily in the future.

433
00:23:46,240 --> 00:23:47,720
Do you know how terrible it is?

434
00:23:48,319 --> 00:23:49,240
How terrible could it be?

435
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:50,279
So bad that I can't even

436
00:23:50,279 --> 00:23:51,079
eat my favorite

437
00:23:51,079 --> 00:23:51,880
milk candies.

438
00:23:51,880 --> 00:23:53,160
I'm afraid it'll dislocate my jaw.

439
00:23:53,759 --> 00:23:54,799
Then don't eat it.

440
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:56,680
How can I do that?

441
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:58,799
I can't just because of fear,

442
00:23:58,799 --> 00:24:00,240
never eat it for the rest of my life.

443
00:24:05,240 --> 00:24:06,319
Don't think too much.

444
00:24:06,759 --> 00:24:08,440
If it really dislocates your jaw, then we'll talk.

445
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:11,000
Try one.

446
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:14,599
If people around you

447
00:24:14,599 --> 00:24:15,920
are afraid your jaw will fall off

448
00:24:16,799 --> 00:24:18,119
and never let you eat candy again,

449
00:24:19,119 --> 00:24:20,000
what should you do?

450
00:24:20,759 --> 00:24:21,480
I can't always

451
00:24:21,480 --> 00:24:22,440
listen to them, right?

452
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:23,599
I want to eat more

453
00:24:23,599 --> 00:24:24,240
and be happier.

454
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:25,559
Let them know I'm fine.

455
00:24:32,880 --> 00:24:33,599
You also try one.

456
00:24:54,480 --> 00:24:54,960
Is it sweet?

457
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:58,759
Hurry up.

458
00:24:58,759 --> 00:24:59,519
I'll teach you.

459
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:01,079
Really?

460
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:06,319
What?

461
00:25:06,319 --> 00:25:07,599
Fu Binyan has heart disease?

462
00:25:08,240 --> 00:25:09,039
Surprised?

463
00:25:09,039 --> 00:25:10,039
Unexpected?

464
00:25:10,359 --> 00:25:11,720
I've been fooled by you.

465
00:25:13,079 --> 00:25:14,720
I really thought it was an accident in a fight.

466
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:16,759
Oh, no.

467
00:25:16,759 --> 00:25:17,799
With such a serious illness,

468
00:25:17,799 --> 00:25:18,440
I actually compared my

469
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:19,680
jaw dislocation with his.

470
00:25:22,039 --> 00:25:23,440
I'm such an idiot.

471
00:25:24,599 --> 00:25:25,160
No,

472
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:26,640
I think

473
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:28,119
you hit the nail on the head by accident.

474
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:29,119
What do you mean?

475
00:25:30,359 --> 00:25:31,799
We just speculated that

476
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,400
Fu Binyan probably hates us the most

477
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,000
for treating him

478
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:35,519
treating him as a patient.

479
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:36,880
But you

480
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:37,359
just don't

481
00:25:37,359 --> 00:25:38,519
take his illness seriously.

482
00:25:38,839 --> 00:25:40,240
You ask him for help when you need it,

483
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,720
and complain to him when you want to.

484
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,279
That's exactly

485
00:25:43,279 --> 00:25:44,200
what he wants.

486
00:25:46,119 --> 00:25:47,279
That makes sense.

487
00:25:47,599 --> 00:25:49,039
So if we treat him as if he's not sick,

488
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:51,039
and just like we always do,

489
00:25:51,039 --> 00:25:52,480
he won't quit the club, right?

490
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:54,799
No.

491
00:25:57,039 --> 00:25:57,960
We can't

492
00:25:57,960 --> 00:25:59,079
ignore his illness.
